# Recorded pty output: raw byte streams that must never be line-ending normalized. The repository's
# `text=auto` makes git guess per file, and it guesses "text" for the ones that happen to contain no binary
# bytes (selective_erasure, sgr) -- committing them then strips every CR, so a bare LF no longer returns to
# column 1 and the replay produces a staircase. Mark them binary so the line-endings survive.
*.recording binary
